{
  "headline": "Nafcillin sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; internal inventory shows Corvale East at 3.5 days on hand for the 2 g/8 mL vial",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include nafcillin sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 55 vials of the 2 g/8 mL presentation with a daily use of 15.9 vials, leaving 3.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 402 vials of the same presentation with a daily use of 15.6 vials, providing 25.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 46 vials with a daily use of 2.9 vials, providing 15.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option by rule is to transfer 168 vials of the 2 g/8 mL vial from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 14 days on hand while Corvale General retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option lists Armas Pharmaceuticals Inc., but its label names no plant that could be placed for regulatory review.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current supply for the 2 g/8 mL vial at Corvale East and Corvale General is labeled by Eugia US LLC under NDC 55150012316, with registered manufacturing plants including Apitoria Pharma Private Limited (VAI 2025-12-12), Aurobindo Pharma Limited (OAI 2025-09-05), and Eugia SEZ Private Limited (VAI 2019-03-01).",
      "cites": ["E4", "E15", "E23", "E26"]
    }
  ]
}
